      "negative": "Checkpoint selection used prior MissBench/UCI monitoring; not pristine holdouts. Observed-column-SD NRMSE 4.000035 / 1.045013 differs from held-out-truth scaling. No verified matched Kumo comparison, calibrated uncertainty, or complete-row/column missingness robustness. Synthetic distribution transfer, large-window memory, data rights and runtime unverified. Paper/project-page claims are not automatically attributable to this exact checkpoint.",
